{"nodes": [{"id": "endringslogg_version_4_0", "label": "Version 4.0 (endringsprompt 3): four bosses, chain keys, homing alerts, Skytsengelen", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 3-115", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "endringslogg_version_3_1", "label": "Version 3.1: code translated to English", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 117-133", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Identifiers, files, API (/api/leaderboard), DB table (entries) renamed to English; in-game text stays Norwegian; behaviour byte-identical (simulator and font verified). localStorage keys (hds_...), debug URLs and Norwegian docs deliberately not translated."}, {"id": "endringslogg_version_3_0", "label": "Version 3.0 (endringsprompt 2): difficulty, characters, sender, new weapons", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 135-246", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "endringslogg_version_2_0", "label": "Version 2.0 (endringsprompt 1): pixel art, map, HUD, performance", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 248-391", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "endringslogg_version_1_0", "label": "Version 1.0: first version", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 393-394", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "endringslogg_sparken", "label": "Mandatory bosses and \u00abDu har f\u00e5tt sparken!\u00bb", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 5-22", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Boss table with countdown, frustration and points (N\u00f8rdic 120 s/850/2500; printer 120 s/2200/4000; Fristen 120 s/4400/6000; Johan 150 s/6500/15000, x1.5 and x1.4 per return). Countdown expiry freezes the game and fires the player; score still submittable; big top clock turns yellow at 30 s and red/blinking at 10 s respecting reduced-flash setting."}, {"id": "endringslogg_nordic_konsulenten", "label": "N\u00f8rdic-konsulenten (boss 1)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 24-29", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fictional company to avoid any real name/logo/colour/typeface. Attacks: hold-music ring (40% slow, 2 s, no damage), ticket splitting into three, \u00abVi ringer deg tilbake\u00bb (uncatchable 3 s, max once per 20 s)."}, {"id": "endringslogg_multifunksjonsmonsteret", "label": "Multifunksjonsmonsteret (boss 2)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 31-35", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "CMYK cartridges become ink puddles (30% slow, 4 s, max 8), 400-page print job sweep, paper jam every ~15 s (stuck 3 s, takes double help)."}, {"id": "endringslogg_fristen_boss", "label": "\u00abFristen er om 2 minutter!\u00bb (boss 3)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 11, 112, 208", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fan of three emails; line \u00abKan du se p\u00e5 dette f\u00f8r lunsj?\u00bb chosen as placeholder because the prompt gave none."}, {"id": "endringslogg_johan", "label": "Johan (final boss)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 37-47", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Drawn in the same style as playable characters at double size. Attacks: sprint (line telegraph, x1.6 damage), five calendar invites, \u00abAlle p\u00e5 m\u00f8te!\u00bb ring of junior associates (once per 30 s within the 400 cap), and earlier bosses' attacks from half frustration. Phase two: takes off the jacket, faster, attacks more often. Returns every 3 minutes."}, {"id": "endringslogg_passord_reset_chain", "label": "Passord-reset as chain weapon / Tofaktor", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 49-51", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Key hops lawyer to lawyer within 80 px, 0.07 s per hop, each lawyer hit at most once per chain; 3 hops at level 1, 10 at level 8. Tofaktor: two chains in opposite directions, 16 hops each."}, {"id": "endringslogg_teams_varsel_homing", "label": "Teams-varsel homing alerts / Allm\u00f8te p\u00e5 Teams", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 52-53", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "v4 changed Teams-varsel from bouncing to homing (1-5 alerts); Allm\u00f8te splits each alert into three on hit."}, {"id": "endringslogg_skytsengelen", "label": "Skytsengelen (new weapon) / Himmelsk serviceavtale", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 55-61", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Hovering untouchable angel throws mini-printers at the nearest lawyer; printers walk, shoot paper, vanish in a paper cloud. Fixed cap 2/4/6 (10 as combination). Brings weapon count to 11."}, {"id": "endringslogg_boss_balance", "label": "Boss balance adjustments (v4)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 63-87, 114", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bosses initially cut good bots' median from 12 to 7 minutes, mostly because bots had to walk into the crowd and got slowed rather than from damage. Fix: 55% fewer regular lawyers during a boss (CONFIG.bosses.spawnFactor), distant boss jogs to catch up (catchUpFrom/catchUpSpeed), lower boss damage and frustration. Result: median 10.5/9.0 min, 3 and 2 of 40 fired."}, {"id": "endringslogg_stresstest_v4", "label": "Stress test results v4 (3.5-3.8 ms/frame)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 89-99", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Stepped with fixed tick because the preview panel throttles requestAnimationFrame. 400 lawyers, Johan out, four combos, utenGPU: 99% of frames under 12 ms, memory flat 4.5-5.8 MB."}, {"id": "endringslogg_difficulty_v3", "label": "Difficulty curve v3 (slower levelling, overtime from 13:00)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 137-185", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "XP per level 20 + 13n + 1.5n^2. Frustration only +8%/min (not +18%) before overtime because combinations were weakened 31-82%, levelling is slower and senders are new; with +18% even expert bots died in 3-5 min. The ~15 min wall comes from overtime: x1.6 per minute on frustration/damage and +15% speed per minute from 13:00, so lawyers outrun the player after ~16-17 min."}, {"id": "endringslogg_combination_nerf", "label": "Combination nerf v3 (87-113% of mean)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 154-171", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Measured with tools/maalvaapen.js (150 lawyers around a moving player). Strongest combos nerfed most (Kontorprinteren -82%, Full omstart -70%) so none is an obvious pick; changes are less help, smaller area, longer cooldown."}, {"id": "endringslogg_characters_v3", "label": "Four playable characters (v3)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 187-198, 236-241", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "32x32 sprites and 64x64 portraits drawn after four reference photos that are not in the project. Weak starting weapons (Toner-kast, HDMI-kabelen, Tr\u00e5dl\u00f8se mus) buffed at levels 1-2 so three of four characters were not clearly weaker than character 1."}, {"id": "endringslogg_haster_sender", "label": "\u00abHaster!\u00bb-avsenderen (v3 ranged lawyer)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 200-208, 242", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Keeps 150-200 px distance, emails every ~3 s at 57 px/s (60% of player speed), only shoots when on screen so the warning is always visible. Caps 15% / 30 / 60 emails."}, {"id": "endringslogg_new_weapons_v3", "label": "Four new weapons/passives/combinations (v3)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 210-224", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ctrl+Z+Hurtigtaster=Ctrl+Alt+Del; Oppdateringsstr\u00e5len+Sertifisering=Tvungen oppdatering; Teams-varsel+Dobbel skjerm=Allm\u00f8te p\u00e5 Teams; St\u00f8ydempende headset+Ergonomisk stol=Hjemmekontor. Passives: Dobbel skjerm (+5% double activation, own RNG stream, burst weapons only), Hurtigtaster (+12% projectile speed), Ergonomisk stol (-6% damage), Sertifisering (+8% XP)."}, {"id": "endringslogg_pixel_art_style", "label": "Pixel art style at 640x360 (v2)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 250-264", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Internal 640x360 canvas scaled with nearest-neighbour (image-rendering: pixelated), integer scale where possible. All sprites are palette-indexed pixel grids in code; 4-frame walk cycle mirrored for left/right."}, {"id": "endringslogg_happy_lawyers", "label": "Visibly happy lawyers (thumbs-up animation)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 266-273", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "When frustration hits zero the lawyer stops, cannot hurt or be hit, drops the ticket; 0.5 s animation, drawn under active lawyers; shortened to 0.25 s when over 60 happy at once."}, {"id": "endringslogg_lawyer_diversity", "label": "Procedurally composed diverse lawyers", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 275-283", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "42 variants for common types, 21 for urgent, 12 for boss, all traits evenly distributed; appearance uses its own RNG stream so it never affects Dagens vakt (simulator confirms)."}, {"id": "endringslogg_max_4_weapons", "label": "Max 4 weapons", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 285-287", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "endringslogg_hud_v2", "label": "Bigger HUD (energy-drink bar, 48px icons)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 289-295", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "HUD drawn on its own full-resolution canvas only when something changed (max ~20 times/s)."}, {"id": "endringslogg_settings_v2", "label": "Settings menu (v2)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 297-301", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mute, master volume, effects (test sound on release), fullscreen, game size, UI size, minimap, screen shake, reduced flashing, reset to defaults. Saved locally with try/catch; sound still off by default (50% when enabled)."}, {"id": "endringslogg_difficulty_curve_v2", "label": "Difficulty curve v2 (phases, ~15 min cap)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 303-310", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "endringslogg_map_minimap", "label": "Bounded office map and minimap (v2)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 312-321", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Replaced the old 'move closer' mechanism: lawyers spawn off-screen (380-560 px), from elevators/doors when crowded, never closer than 260 px. Minimap updated 10 times per second."}, {"id": "endringslogg_energy_drink", "label": "Energy drink must be fetched (v2)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 323-328, 375-376", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No longer drops from lawyers; first at 0:30 then every 35 s, max 3, at least 960 px away. Placement uses its own RNG stream ('drikk') because the drop stream is consumed per helped lawyer and would give different places to different players."}, {"id": "endringslogg_performance_v2", "label": "Performance overhaul v2 (causes of v1 stutter)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 330-369", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "v1 stutter causes: downscaled 3x sprites transformed each frame (~0.47 ms per figure without GPU, >200 ms per frame at 300 lawyers), full-screen canvas fills, GC churn from per-frame colour strings, up to 5 logic updates per frame. Fixes: 640x360 world canvas, 1:1 sprite copies, pre-rendered map canvas, cached effect sprites (no shadowBlur/gradients), fixed timestep max 4 updates, max 400 active lawyers (extra ones 'saved' and buff the next), sound buffers reused. Stress test: 2.86 ms avg, 0 frames over 16.7 ms."}, {"id": "endringslogg_sprite_atlas", "label": "One sprite atlas per figure type", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 345-348", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Drawing from many small canvases measured ~20x slower (0.09 vs 0.004 ms per figure). Atlases are built during the start screen and never changed in-game because modifying an atlas mid-game caused 150-600 ms spikes from re-uploading the whole atlas."}, {"id": "endringslogg_object_pools", "label": "Object pools and swap-and-pop", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 354-355", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No filter/map/new objects per frame in the game loop; max 60 projectiles per weapon and 900 effects; projectiles removed when off-screen."}, {"id": "endringslogg_spatial_grid", "label": "Spatial grid (32 px cells) for collisions", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "line 356", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All collisions use a 32 px grid; lawyer-to-lawyer pushing checks at most 6 neighbours."}, {"id": "endringslogg_auto_quality", "label": "Automatic quality level", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 361-363", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "If frame time exceeds 16.5 ms for 1.5 s, glitter, speech bubbles, happy animation and effect fills are reduced in two steps, restored after 8 s of good frames. Lives only in render code so it can never affect game logic (determinism)."}, {"id": "endringslogg_kontorpiksel", "label": "KontorPiksel own pixel font (CC0)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 263-264, 372-373", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A self-made CC0 font was created instead of fetching an OFL font because nothing may be loaded from the internet. Used both as TTF in menus and drawn directly on the canvas."}, {"id": "endringslogg_rng_streams", "label": "Separate RNG streams for determinism", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 375-379", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Spawn positions depend on where the player stands, so they come from their own stream ('plass'); timing and types still come from the spawn stream so they are identical for everyone. Energy drink uses the 'drikk' stream."}, {"id": "endringslogg_leaderboard_limits", "label": "Leaderboard plausibility limits", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 103-105, 390-391", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Max 5000 points and 50 helped per second before a run is considered unrealistic; v4 added the fired column (auto-migrated) and aligned checks with the new boss order."}], "edges": [{"source": "endringslogg_version_4_0", "target": "endringslogg_sparken", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 5-22", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "endringslogg_version_4_0", "target": "endringslogg_nordic_konsulenten", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 24-29", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "endringslogg_version_4_0", "target": "endringslogg_multifunksjonsmonsteret", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 31-35", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "endringslogg_version_4_0", "target": "endringslogg_fristen_boss", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "line 11", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "endringslogg_version_4_0", "target": "endringslogg_johan", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 37-47", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "endringslogg_version_4_0", "target": "endringslogg_passord_reset_chain", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 49-51", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "endringslogg_version_4_0", "target": "endringslogg_teams_varsel_homing", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 52-53", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "endringslogg_version_4_0", "target": "endringslogg_skytsengelen", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 55-61", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "endringslogg_version_4_0", "target": "endringslogg_boss_balance", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 63-87", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "endringslogg_version_4_0", "target": "endringslogg_stresstest_v4", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 89-99", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "endringslogg_version_4_0", "target": "endringslogg_leaderboard_limits", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ENDRINGSLOGG.md", "source_location": "lines 103-105", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "endringslogg_version_4_0", "tar